WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:16.950
Cole sneezed.

2
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:19.591
"Bless you," Henry said.

3
00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:22.732
"Thanks." Cole sniffed.

4
00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:24.993
"I'm allergic to cats."

5
00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.635
It was two days after the family barbecue.

6
00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:31.596
Henry was in the car with Cole and Maggie.

7
00:00:32.712 --> 00:00:34.614
Uncle Bruce was driving them to the barn.

8
00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:41.959
Maggie had another riding lesson, and the boys were going along to investigate the mystery of her missing

9
00:00:42.079 --> 00:00:45.562
stuff. "Sorry, Cole," Uncle Bruce said.

10
00:00:45.582 --> 00:00:48.264
"Maggie's kittens have never been in the car.

11
00:00:49.285 --> 00:00:52.747
But their hair gets all over everything, especially Maggie's clothes."

12
00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:58.732
"At least the car doesn't smell like horses," Henry told Cole with a smile.

13
00:00:59.932 --> 00:01:02.873
"Uncle Bruce makes Maggie put on her riding boots at the barn."

14
00:01:04.054 --> 00:01:06.475
He pointed to a bag on the seat beside Maggie.

15
00:01:07.595 --> 00:01:12.017
Her boots and socks were inside, along with her helmet and other riding gear.

16
00:01:15.478 --> 00:01:18.480
Cole was the first one out of the car when they reached the barn.

17
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.340
"Fresh air!"

18
00:01:20.741 --> 00:01:21.701
he cried happily.

19
00:01:21.721 --> 00:01:23.942
"I can breathe again!"

20
00:01:25.102 --> 00:01:26.263
Maggie rolled her eyes.

21
00:01:26.283 --> 00:01:28.664
"Don't get too excited.

22
00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.461
There's a barn cat who lives here.

23
00:01:32.461 --> 00:01:33.801
Look, there she is."

24
00:01:35.002 --> 00:01:38.403
She pointed to a cat who was sleeping in the sun on top of a hay bale.

25
00:01:38.423 --> 00:01:41.504
"That's okay," Cole said.

26
00:01:41.524 --> 00:01:44.925
"I don't usually sneeze when a cat is outside."

27
00:01:45.925 --> 00:01:48.966
They waved good-bye to Maggie's dad and hurried into the barn.

28
00:01:48.986 --> 00:01:52.907
"The pony I ride is over here," Maggie said.

29
00:01:52.927 --> 00:01:55.188
"His name is Spot."

30
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.701
She stopped in front of a horse stall and set down her bag.

31
00:02:00.881 --> 00:02:01.981
A pony looked out at them.

32
00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:05.602
When Maggie patted him, he nibbled on her hair.

33
00:02:07.143 --> 00:02:09.323
Maggie giggled and gently pushed his head away.

34
00:02:09.343 --> 00:02:12.544
"Stop that, Spot!"

35
00:02:13.705 --> 00:02:14.705
Henry heard a bark.

36
00:02:15.905 --> 00:02:17.286
A dog came running toward them.

37
00:02:18.446 --> 00:02:19.686
His tail was wagging.

38
00:02:20.867 --> 00:02:23.407
A girl Henry didn't recognize came running too.

39
00:02:23.427 --> 00:02:25.788
"Come back here, Spot!"

40
00:02:27.148 --> 00:02:30.970
"Hey! This dog has the same name as Maggie's pony!"

41
00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.150
Cole exclaimed.

42
00:02:33.751 --> 00:02:35.311
He stooped to pat the dog.

43
00:02:36.312 --> 00:02:38.773
Cole wasn't allergic to dogs, just cats.

44
00:02:40.013 --> 00:02:40.794
Maggie nodded.

45
00:02:40.814 --> 00:02:46.596
"Everyone calls the pony Big Spot and the dog Little Spot," she explained.

46
00:02:46.616 --> 00:02:49.477
"Little Spot belongs to Eleanor.

47
00:02:50.578 --> 00:02:52.759
She's one of the other riders in my group lesson."

48
00:02:54.379 --> 00:02:56.020
By now Eleanor had reached them.

49
00:02:58.233 --> 00:03:01.196
"Hi," she said breathlessly.

50
00:03:01.216 --> 00:03:03.437
"Sorry about that.

51
00:03:04.358 --> 00:03:06.000
But Little Spot is friendly."

52
00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:08.582
"We don't mind," Cole said.

53
00:03:08.602 --> 00:03:10.243
"He's cute."

54
00:03:10.263 --> 00:03:14.287
"Thanks." Eleanor picked up Little Spot.

55
00:03:14.307 --> 00:03:16.168
"See you later.

56
00:03:17.149 --> 00:03:18.770
I need to get my pony ready."

57
00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:20.512
She hurried off.

58
00:03:20.532 --> 00:03:23.875
"Shouldn't you be getting Big Spot ready?"

59
00:03:24.195 --> 00:03:25.236
Cole asked Maggie.

60
00:03:26.492 --> 00:03:29.593
"I want to show you around the barn first," Maggie said.

61
00:03:29.613 --> 00:03:32.714
"That way you can start investigating."

62
00:03:32.734 --> 00:03:35.715
"Good idea," Henry agreed.

63
00:03:36.775 --> 00:03:38.775
He and Cole followed Maggie down the aisle.

64
00:03:40.716 --> 00:03:43.237
A horse or pony looked out of each stall they passed.

65
00:03:44.737 --> 00:03:46.697
Then they saw a pony standing in the aisle.

66
00:03:47.898 --> 00:03:50.438
A boy was brushing it while a teenage girl watched.

67
00:03:51.579 --> 00:03:53.099
The girl was holding a pitchfork.

68
00:03:53.119 --> 00:03:57.069
"You're not doing that right, Zach," she complained.

69
00:03:57.089 --> 00:04:00.451
"You're supposed to move the brush in circles."

70
00:04:00.471 --> 00:04:04.134
"Leave me alone, Jill," the boy said.

71
00:04:05.755 --> 00:04:07.756
Henry recognized them from his neighborhood.

72
00:04:08.837 --> 00:04:10.658
Zach was in Maggie's class at school.

73
00:04:11.739 --> 00:04:13.180
Jill was Zach's older sister.

74
00:04:14.381 --> 00:04:17.423
She and her friend Ashley sometimes came to the lemonade stand.

75
00:04:17.443 --> 00:04:20.125
"Hi, Zach," Henry said.

76
00:04:20.145 --> 00:04:22.706
"I didn't know you rode horses."

77
00:04:22.726 --> 00:04:24.668
"I just started."

78
00:04:25.844 --> 00:04:26.565
Zach frowned.

79
00:04:26.585 --> 00:04:31.388
"My parents are making me because my sister has a dumb part-time job here."

80
00:04:31.408 --> 00:04:36.032
"You'd have fun if you had a better attitude," Jill told him.

81
00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:39.294
Just then a woman walked toward them.

82
00:04:39.314 --> 00:04:42.757
"Did you finish cleaning the stalls, Jill?"

83
00:04:43.137 --> 00:04:43.737
she asked.

84
00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:45.779
"Not yet, Ms.

85
00:04:45.839 --> 00:04:49.081
Wood." Jill hurried off to finish her chores.

86
00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:52.264
Maggie introduced Henry and Cole to Ms.

87
00:04:52.324 --> 00:04:57.896
Wood. "She owns the barn and teaches all the lessons," Maggie explained.

88
00:04:59.457 --> 00:05:00.538
Ms. Wood smiled.

89
00:05:01.719 --> 00:05:03.841
"Nice to meet you, boys," she said.

90
00:05:03.861 --> 00:05:07.124
"Maggie, it's time to get Big Spot ready.

91
00:05:08.205 --> 00:05:09.907
And you need to change into your riding boots.

92
00:05:10.988 --> 00:05:13.430
It's not safe to wear sandals in the barn."

93
00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:17.473
"Sorry, I was just about to do that," Maggie said.

94
00:05:17.493 --> 00:05:19.395
"Come on, you guys."

95
00:05:23.084 --> 00:05:24.425
They headed back down the aisle.

96
00:05:25.566 --> 00:05:27.208
On the way, they passed another girl.

97
00:05:28.349 --> 00:05:29.770
Henry recognized her too.

98
00:05:31.011 --> 00:05:34.394
Her name was Daisy, and she was two years ahead of him at school.

99
00:05:34.414 --> 00:05:37.276
"Hi, Maggie," Daisy said.

100
00:05:37.296 --> 00:05:39.819
"Am I late for our lesson?"

101
00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:42.541
"Not yet," Maggie told her.

102
00:05:42.561 --> 00:05:44.563
"But you'd better hurry."

103
00:05:45.664 --> 00:05:46.645
Daisy rushed away.

104
00:05:46.665 --> 00:05:50.208
"I didn't know Daisy was a rider," Cole said.

105
00:05:51.772 --> 00:05:55.494
"She started taking lessons at the same time I did," Maggie explained.

106
00:05:55.514 --> 00:05:58.396
"How many people are in your lesson?"

107
00:05:58.736 --> 00:05:59.456
Henry asked.

108
00:05:59.476 --> 00:06:02.498
"You just met them all," Maggie said.

109
00:06:02.518 --> 00:06:06.260
"It's Daisy, Zach, Eleanor, and me."

110
00:06:07.741 --> 00:06:08.441
Henry nodded.

111
00:06:09.562 --> 00:06:11.923
So far he hadn't seen anything suspicious.

112
00:06:13.044 --> 00:06:15.946
But he wanted to keep track of all the possible suspects.

113
00:06:17.126 --> 00:06:19.888
They turned the corner and saw Big Spot's stall.

114
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.566
Maggie hurried to her bag and pulled out her riding boots.

115
00:06:23.586 --> 00:06:27.395
"Oh no," she moaned.

116
00:06:27.415 --> 00:06:30.301
"One of my socks is missing!"
